      "name": "wh.ap",
      "created_at": "2024-05-22T14:06:15.805Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the “Employee” master, I use “Customize Form” in order to change the “Options” property of the Series field which is of type “Select”…</p>\n<p>When I do this, I get this error message:<br>\nYou can’t set ‘Options’ for field Series</p>\n<p>Is there a way to achieve the customization I need?<br>\nI am using Frappe version 15</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/7/67c42cfebfb8775a7446a3b2bc72fce1d3138305.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/67c42cfebfb8775a7446a3b2bc72fce1d3138305\" title=\"لقطة شاشة_22-5-2024_16412_localhost\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/7/67c42cfebfb8775a7446a3b2bc72fce1d3138305_2_690x406.jpeg\" alt=\"لقطة شاشة_22-5-2024_16412_localhost\" data-base62-sha1=\"eNXu0PMIHOKpCeyrDgdgLJyo8Xr\" width=\"690\" height=\"406\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/7/67c42cfebfb8775a7446a3b2bc72fce1d3138305_2_690x406.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/7/67c42cfebfb8775a7446a3b2bc72fce1d3138305_2_1035x609.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/7/67c42cfebfb8775a7446a3b2bc72fce1d3138305.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"6C6C6B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">لقطة شاشة_22-5-2024_16412_localhost</span><span class=\"informations\">1372×809 118 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
