      "created_at": "2024-05-22T14:08:14.025Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yaah, if it’s a standard DocType, then you can’t customize some standard fields directly by Customize Form…</p>\n<p>In your case, you can use the <strong>Property Setter</strong> feature to override the standard field property found in doctype…</p>",
